  "{n} nga këto tregti dolën larg SL-së dhe TP-së së sinjalit — pra u mbyllën me dorë ose u lëvizën nivelet.": "{n} of these trades exited far from the signal's SL and TP — so they were closed by hand or the levels were moved.",
