  "Kill-switch": "Kill-switch",
  "Këto 3 butona ruhen <span class=\"text-gray-300\">menjëherë</span>. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Kill-switch ON</span> ndalon çdo trade (urgjencë).": "These 3 buttons are saved <span class=\"text-gray-300\">immediately</span>. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Kill-switch ON</span> stops every trade (emergency).",
  "Mode LIVE përdor para reale. Sigurohu që e ke testuar në demo.": "LIVE mode uses real money. Make sure you have tested it in demo.",
