  "Shfaqen vetëm 24 orët e fundit. \"Skadoi\" = s'u prek as TP as SL brenda afatit — u mbyll pa u vendosur.": "Only the last 24 hours are shown. \"Expired\" = neither TP nor SL was hit within the window — closed undecided.",
