  "Filtrat që kaloi": "Filters it passed",
  "Pa detaje analize.": "No analysis details.",
  "Sinjali u gjenerua nga motori mbi çmime LIVE kur këto filtra u plotësuan njëkohësisht. Afat-gjatë = mbahet më gjatë (orë/ditë); afat-shkurt = lëvizje e shpejtë.": "The signal was generated by the engine on LIVE prices when these filters were met at the same time. Long-term = held longer (hours/days); short-term = a quick move.",
