  "Vetëm pamje — çmimet vijnë automatik nga sistemi.": "View only — prices come automatically from the system.",
  "<strong>Groq është FALAS.</strong> Hapat: 1) Hap <a href=\"https://console.groq.com/keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">console.groq.com/keys</a> → 2) Krijo llogari falas → 3) Krijo një çelës → 4) Ngjite poshtë.<br />Model i sugjeruar: <code class=\"text-white\">llama-3.3-70b-versatile</code>": "<strong>Groq is FREE.</strong> Steps: 1) Open <a href=\"https://console.groq.com/keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">console.groq.com/keys</a> → 2) Create a free account → 3) Create a key → 4) Paste it below.<br />Suggested model: <code class=\"text-white\">llama-3.3-70b-versatile</code>",
  "Hap <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/api-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">platform.openai.com/api-keys</a> → krijo çelës (fillon me <code class=\"text-white\">sk-...</code>). Kërkon kredite. Model: <code class=\"text-white\">gpt-4o</code>": "Open <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/api-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">platform.openai.com/api-keys</a> → create a key (starts with <code class=\"text-white\">sk-...</code>). Requires credits. Model: <code class=\"text-white\">gpt-4o</code>",
  "Hap <a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">aistudio.google.com/app/apikey</a> → krijo çelës (ka plan falas). Model: <code class=\"text-white\">gemini-1.5-flash</code>": "Open <a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">aistudio.google.com/app/apikey</a> → create a key (has a free plan). Model: <code class=\"text-white\">gemini-1.5-flash</code>",
  "Hap <a href=\"https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">console.anthropic.com/settings/keys</a> → krijo çelës (fillon me <code class=\"text-white\">sk-ant-...</code>) dhe sigurohu që ke <strong>kredite/billing</strong> aktiv te <a href=\"https://console.anthropic.com/settings/billing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">Billing</a>.<br />Modele aktuale: <code class=\"text-white\">claude-opus-4-8</code> (Opus, më i fuqishëm) · <code class=\"text-white\">claude-sonnet-4-6</code> (më i lirë/shpejtë).": "Open <a href=\"https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">console.anthropic.com/settings/keys</a> → create a key (starts with <code class=\"text-white\">sk-ant-...</code>) and make sure you have active <strong>credits/billing</strong> at <a href=\"https://console.anthropic.com/settings/billing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline font-semibold\">Billing</a>.<br />Current models: <code class=\"text-white\">claude-opus-4-8</code> (Opus, most powerful) · <code class=\"text-white\">claude-sonnet-4-6</code> (cheaper/faster).",
  "Si funksionon": "How it works",
  "Si funksionon sistemi": "How the system works",
  "ProTrade Lab — mësimi": "ProTrade Lab — learning",
  "Mësimi nga rezultatet — win-rate sipas kushteve + sugjerime nga Claude.": "Learning from results — win-rate by condition + suggestions from Claude.",
  "Po mblidhen të dhëna…": "Collecting data…",
  "\"Pikat kyçe\" ruhen për çdo sinjal të ri (Faza 2). Analiza bëhet e besueshme pas ~100 sinjalesh të mbyllura. Kthehu pas disa ditësh tregtimi.": "\"Key points\" are saved for each new signal (Phase 2). The analysis becomes reliable after ~100 closed signals. Come back after a few days of trading.",
  "Sinjale të mbyllura": "Closed signals",
  "Win-rate": "Win-rate",
  "Fitime / Humbje": "Wins / Losses",
  "Mesatare rezultati": "Average result",
  "Mostër e vogël ({n}). Përfundimet bëhen të besueshme pas ~100 sinjalesh — mos ndrysho strategjinë ende.": "Small sample ({n}). Conclusions become reliable after ~100 signals — don't change the strategy yet.",
  "Claude Strategjist (Faza 4)": "Claude Strategist (Phase 4)",
  "Duke analizuar…": "Analyzing…",
