  "Filtri i forcës (ADX ≥ 18)": "Strength filter (ADX ≥ 18)",
  "Filtri i volatilitetit (ATR)": "Volatility filter (ATR)",
  "Trendi ditor (D1, EMA50)": "Daily trend (D1, EMA50)",
  "Confluence + besueshmëri": "Confluence + confidence",
  "Llogarit Entry / SL / TP": "Calculate Entry / SL / TP",
  "0 · Tregu i hapur": "0 · Market open",
  "1 · Sesioni": "1 · Session",
  "2 · Blackout EIA": "2 · EIA blackout",
  "3 · Besueshmëria": "3 · Confidence",
  "4 · R:R neto": "4 · Net R:R",
