  "MetaApi e bllokon validimin për ~1 orë. MOS kliko Deploy/Retry vazhdimisht — çdo përpjekje e rinis orën. Prit 1 orë, pastaj vazhdo.": "MetaApi blocks validation for ~1 hour. Do NOT keep clicking Deploy/Retry — each attempt resets the hour. Wait 1 hour, then continue.",
  "High Reliability:": "High Reliability:",
  "te MetaApi vendos Reliability = High → 2 servera rezervë, uptime ~99.96%. Zgjidhja kryesore kundër shkëputjeve (me pagesë).": "in MetaApi set Reliability = High → 2 redundant servers, uptime ~99.96%. The main fix against disconnects (paid).",
