  "Mos spam Deploy:": "Don't spam Deploy:",
  "një Deploy i vetëm, pastaj prit 2–5 min derisa të bëhet jeshile (Connected + Synchronized).": "a single Deploy, then wait 2–5 min until it turns green (Connected + Synchronized).",
  "Për stabilitet maksimal:": "For maximum stability:",
