  "MACD = EMA12 − EMA26 · Sinjal = EMA9(MACD) · Hist = MACD − Sinjal": "MACD = EMA12 − EMA26 · Signal = EMA9(MACD) · Hist = MACD − Signal",
  "TR = max(H−L, |H−Cdje|, |L−Cdje|) · ATR = mesatare Wilder e TR": "TR = max(H−L, |H−Cyest|, |L−Cyest|) · ATR = Wilder average of TR",
  "distSL = ATR(1h) × 1.5  (naftë: × 2.0, më volatile)\nTP = distSL × 2   →   Risk:Reward = 1:2": "distSL = ATR(1h) × 1.5  (oil: × 2.0, more volatile)\nTP = distSL × 2   →   Risk:Reward = 1:2",
  "rrezikuPerTrade = min(kapital × rrezik%, kufiriDitor)\nlot = rrezikuPerTrade / (distSL × vleraPerÇmim)": "riskPerTrade = min(capital × risk%, dailyLimit)\nlot = riskPerTrade / (distSL × valuePerPrice)",
  // ---- Shtesa: faqet standarde (Journal, ekrani i plotë, VIP-box, verifikimi) ----
  "<span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold\">Metoda A (Roboti, %):</span> mban p.sh. 50% të fitimit, çdo ~7s. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">E rekomanduar për shumicën</span> — e parashikueshme dhe ndjek fitimin sipas %.": "<span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold\">Method A (Robot, %):</span> keeps e.g. 50% of the profit, every ~7s. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Recommended for most</span> — predictable and tracks profit by %.",
  "<span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold\">Metoda B (MT5, tick-by-tick):</span> ndjek me distancë fikse pas çdo tiku — më e shpejtë, por jo me %. Provoje në DEMO së pari.": "<span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold\">Method B (MT5, tick-by-tick):</span> trails at a fixed distance after every tick — faster, but not %-based. Try it on DEMO first.",
  "<span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold\">ℹ️ Mbrojtja \"qëndro në profit\":</span> sapo trade-i shkon në fitim, SL ngrihet drejt hyrjes; nëse momentumi kthehet, mbyllet që të mbash fitimin. <span class=\"text-gray-400\">SL shumë i ngushtë (p.sh. 2$) preket shpesh nga zhurma — normale për scalp.</span>": "<span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold\">ℹ️ \"Stay in profit\" protection:</span> as soon as the trade goes into profit, the SL is raised toward the entry; if momentum reverses, it closes so you keep the profit. <span class=\"text-gray-400\">A very tight SL (e.g. $2) gets hit often by noise — normal for scalping.</span>",
  "<span class=\"text-blue-300 font-semibold\">Rruga A (pending te brokeri):</span> respekton nivelin tënd të hyrjes, por varet nga brokeri (mund të mos e pranojë kur tregu mbyllur).": "<span class=\"text-blue-300 font-semibold\">Route A (pending at the broker):</span> respects your entry level, but depends on the broker (it may reject it while the market is closed).",
  "<span class=\"text-gray-300\">Që trailing-u të punojë, çdo trade duhet të ketë SL.</span> Të dyja metodat e ngrenë SL vetëm përpara — kurrë mbrapa.": "<span class=\"text-gray-300\">For trailing to work, every trade must have an SL.</span> Both methods only move the SL forward — never backward.",
  "<span class=\"text-green-400 font-semibold\">Rruga B (radha jonë):</span> hyn në hapje me çmimin e tregut, e parashikueshme. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">E rekomanduar për shumicën.</span>": "<span class=\"text-green-400 font-semibold\">Route B (our queue):</span> enters at the open with the market price, predictable. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Recommended for most.</span>",
  "<strong class=\"text-white\">Llogaria MT5 (Vantage)</strong> — duhet ta kesh tashmë (Login, Password, Server p.sh. <code class=\"text-amber-300\">VantageInternational-Demo</code>). Nëse jo, hape te <a href=\"https://www.vantagemarkets.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-amber-400 underline\">vantagemarkets.com</a> ose shkarko <a href=\"https://www.metatrader5.com/en/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-amber-400 underline\">MetaTrader 5</a>.": "<strong class=\"text-white\">MT5 account (Vantage)</strong> — you should already have one (Login, Password, Server e.g. <code class=\"text-amber-300\">VantageInternational-Demo</code>). If not, open one at <a href=\"https://www.vantagemarkets.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-amber-400 underline\">vantagemarkets.com</a> or download <a href=\"https://www.metatrader5.com/en/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-amber-400 underline\">MetaTrader 5</a>.",
