  "Lot-i, TP-të, SL rezervë, max pozicionet dhe mbrojtja shkallë-shkallë rregullohen te karta e secilit kanal më lart.": "Lot, TPs, fallback SL, max positions and step-by-step protection are configured on each channel's card above.",
  "Loti nuk kalon kurrë <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Lot maksimal</span>. Kur <span class=\"text-gray-300\">JOAKTIV</span>, përdoret gjithmonë <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Lot default</span>.": "The lot never exceeds <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Max lot</span>. When <span class=\"text-gray-300\">OFF</span>, <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Default lot</span> is always used.",
