  "P.sh.: Çfarë funksionoi sot? Çfarë gabimi bëra? A e ndoqa planin? Emocionet? Mësimi për nesër…": "E.g.: What worked today? What mistake did I make? Did I follow the plan? Emotions? Lesson for tomorrow…",
  "POZITIV": "POSITIVE",
  "Porosia dërgohet te brokeri si <span class=\"text-gray-300\">pending (limit/stop)</span> te niveli yt i hyrjes — hyn vetëm kur çmimi e prek atë nivel pas hapjes. ⚠️ Jo çdo broker e pranon kur tregu është i mbyllur; nëse e refuzon, porosia bie automatik te radha (Rruga B) që të mos humbasë.": "The order is sent to the broker as <span class=\"text-gray-300\">pending (limit/stop)</span> at your entry level — it enters only when the price touches that level after the open. ⚠️ Not every broker accepts it while the market is closed; if rejected, the order automatically falls back to the queue (Route B) so it is not lost.",
  "Porosia rri në pritje derisa çmimi të arrijë hyrjen (ose derisa të mbyllet nga sinjali/ti).": "The order stays pending until the price reaches the entry (or until it is closed by the signal/you).",
  "Porosia ruhet te <span class=\"text-gray-300\">radha jonë</span> dhe roboti e dërgon si <span class=\"text-gray-300\">porosi tregu</span> pikërisht kur hapet tregu — hyn me çmimin e hapjes. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">E parashikueshme dhe 100% nën kontrollin tonë</span> (s'varet nga brokeri). Kërkon SL për siguri.": "The order is stored in <span class=\"text-gray-300\">our queue</span> and the robot sends it as a <span class=\"text-gray-300\">market order</span> exactly when the market opens — it enters at the opening price. <span class=\"text-gray-300\">Predictable and 100% under our control</span> (does not depend on the broker). Requires an SL for safety.",
